# 🧩 Task Manager API

A Python-based REST API for managing tasks using **Flask**.  
This project demonstrates clean API design, CRUD operations, and proper RESTful principles — ideal for beginners and data-driven app prototypes.

---

## 🚀 Features
- ✅ Create, Read, Update, and Delete (CRUD) tasks  
- 🔐 In-memory data handling (no database required)  
- 🧭 REST API built with Flask and Flask-RESTful  
- ⚡ Clean and modular codebase  
- 🧰 Easy to extend with database or authentication later  

---

## 🧠 Tech Stack
- **Python 3.x**  
- **Flask**  
- **Flask-RESTful**  
- **JSON**  

---

## 🧩 API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint        | Description         |
|--------|------------------|---------------------|
| GET    | `/tasks`         | Fetch all tasks     |
| POST   | `/tasks`         | Create a new task   |
| GET    | `/tasks/<id>`    | Fetch task by ID    |
| PUT    | `/tasks/<id>`    | Update task details |
| DELETE | `/tasks/<id>`    | Delete a task       |

